	(text_box "DANGER_V threshold check:\n\nV_VEHI is the scaled HV vehicle-side voltage.\nScaling: V_VEHI = V_HV / 242.03\n\nThreshold reference:\nV_REF = 3.3V * R_LOW / (R_HIGH + R_LOW)\n\nFor approx. 40V HV threshold:\nR_HIGH = 68k\nR_LOW  = 3.3k\n\nV_REF ≈ 0.153V\nV_HV_threshold ≈ 0.153V * 242.03 ≈ 37V\n\nDANGER_V:\nIN+ = V_VEHI\nIN- = V_REF\nHIGH / released when V_VEHI > V_REF\n=> vehicle side voltage above approx. 37V\n\nnDANGER_V:\nIN+ = V_REF\nIN- = V_VEHI\nLOW when V_VEHI > V_REF\n=> active-low status / interlock signal"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 234.95 89.5876 0)
		(size 39.37 43.7624)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
			(color 0 0 0 1)
		)
